      "output": "Ah Q is not only his name and place of origin somewhat obscure; even his former record is vague. For the people of Wuzhuang, he is used only for help and only made fun of. They never pay attention to his record. Ah Q himself does not speak of it, but when he argues with others, he occasionally glares and says: \"We were once much more prosperous than you! What do you amount to?\"",
